# Allow-list: the build context is only what docker/Dockerfile COPYs — the
# root workspace manifests, packages/*, apps/bridge and docker/. Everything
# else (apps/mobile, apps/android, crates/, vendor/, runtime data/, Rust
# target/, toolchains) is never read by the image, so it is never sent to the
# daemon or hashed.
*
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/
!apps/bridge/
!docker/

# Inside the allowed trees: build output, deps, and tests. Tests are excluded
# so editing one never invalidates the image's build layers.
**/node_modules
**/out
**/dist
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/vitest.config.*
